util/gxde-wm-shim/
------------------

The util/gxde-wm-shim/ directory is imported with its full history from the
catos-kwin-x11-integration branch of gxde-wm-shim, which is based on deepin's
dde-kwin:

  GXDE fork: https://github.com/GXDE-OS/gxde-wm-shim
  Upstream:  https://github.com/linuxdeepin/dde-kwin

It keeps its own licensing, declared in util/gxde-wm-shim/REUSE.toml and with
the license texts in util/gxde-wm-shim/LICENSES/:

  GPL-3.0-or-later   sources, scripts, configuration and packaging
  CC-BY-4.0          documentation (*.md)
  CC0-1.0            CI configuration

Copyright holders, as recorded in its source and history:

  2017 Deepin.Inc <support@deepin.com>
  2018-2024 UnionTech Software Technology Co., Ltd.
  2025-2026 gfdgd_xi <3025613752@qq.com>
  2026 Aromatic <symwww@outlook.com>

The KWin scripts were written by zccrs <zccrs@live.com> and justforlxz
<lxz@mkacg.com>, see their metadata.json. Every other contributor is listed in
the git history of this source (git log af2f13c393^2).

The compatibility helper built from util/gxde-wm-shim/deepin-wm-dbus/ is a
separate program. It is not linked with the KWin libraries, which remain under
the licenses listed above.

data/gxde-kwin_x11rc
--------------------

The default settings installed as /etc/xdg/gxde-kwin_x11rc follow
/etc/xdg/deepin-kwinrc of deepin-kwin (GXDE package gxde-kwin-data):

  Copyright: UnionTech Software Technology Co., Ltd.
  License:   GPL-2.0-or-later

The Debian packaging files may be redistributed under GPL-2.0-or-later.
